1
00:00:00,610 --> 00:00:03,890
(Amy:)Would have been more flattered
if you were a homosexual.

2
00:00:05,610 --> 00:00:07,610
(Penny:)Guys, how 'bout
some music?

3
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:09,180
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, I wouldn't
care for that.

4
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:10,200
(Penny:)Amy?

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,350
(Amy:)No, thank you.

6
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:13,170
(Howard:)Okay.

7
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:15,400
(Sheldon:)Uncomfortable
silence it is.

8
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:22,130
(Penny:)Hey, Sheldon, have you told Amy

9
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:24,550
(Penny:)what it was like for you
growing up in Texas?

10
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:26,460
(Howard:)No.

11
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:30,030
(Penny:)Well, why don't
you tell her?

12
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:32,420
(Penny:)All right.

13
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:33,750
(Sheldon:)It was hell.

14
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:37,810
(Penny:)Any follow up, Amy?

15
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:40,810
(Howard:)No.

16
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:47,320
(Penny:)I myself grew
up in Nebraska.

17
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:49,220
(Penny:)Small town
outside of Omaha.

18
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:53,320
(Penny:)Nice place, mostly family farms,
a few meth labs.

19
00:00:54,490 --> 00:00:57,900
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, how is this better
than uncomfortable silence?

20
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:58,900
(Penny:)I don't know.

21
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:01,020
(Penny:)I was just trying something.

